#~ msgid "<em>Tuning Tip:</em> If you want the Konqueror web browser to start faster, you can turn off this information screen by clicking <a href=\"%1\">here</a>. You can re-enable it by choosing the Help -> Konqueror Introduction menu option, and then pressing Settings -> Save View Profile \"Web Browsing\"."
